WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:34.520
This is great!

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:39.730
Yang Spring Restaurant is closed today.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:43.040
We’ve decided to go for a picnic

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:44.940
and have a fishing competition.

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.690
We could use relaxation once in a while.

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:51.340
Zhou Yu,

00:01:51.830 --> 00:01:53.520
hold your horses.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.260
Hear me out first!

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.790
So,

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:01.220
can you all hear me

00:02:01.790 --> 00:02:02.780
in the back?

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:03.900
Loud and clear,

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:04.530
geezer!

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:05.050
Silang...

00:02:05.470 --> 00:02:06.850
Look,

00:02:07.220 --> 00:02:09.930
whoever gets the biggest fish

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:12.000
will win a prize.

00:02:12.050 --> 00:02:13.250
There’s a prize, too?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:14.050
What is it?

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:17.830
A brand-new ladle!

00:02:18.060 --> 00:02:18.710
Come on!

00:02:18.760 --> 00:02:19.440
That’s cheap!

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:20.320
No, thank you.

00:02:20.590 --> 00:02:22.630
Yes! I want it!

00:02:22.890 --> 00:02:25.500
Why do you want that, Mao?

00:02:26.700 --> 00:02:28.410
Mao is always eager to win

00:02:28.540 --> 00:02:30.230
whether it’s cooking or fishing.

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:33.260
Alright. Game on!

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.270
What are you doing,

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.230
Mao?

00:02:43.220 --> 00:02:44.800
I’m sorry. My bad.

00:02:45.820 --> 00:02:48.870
Fry like this won’t make you win, Mao.

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:51.360
I’m no fry!

00:02:54.140 --> 00:02:56.830
The Outdoor Cuisine of Friendship

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:02.620
Can’t get any fish here.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:03.670
I'm going over there.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.380
Wait, the old spot is better.

00:03:08.990 --> 00:03:10.530
No, I’m going to that side.

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:13.790
Stop running around, Mao.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:16.180
Zhou Yu is having a bite.

00:03:18.910 --> 00:03:20.580
So big!

00:03:20.580 --> 00:03:21.700
It’s at least 10 kilos.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:22.550
I guess so.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:29.500
Zhou Yu is a master chef

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:31.560
but certainly not a fisherman.

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:35.520
We’re here today to put work behind

00:03:35.670 --> 00:03:37.590
and have fun.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.590
It doesn’t matter if I catch anything.

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.250
Really?

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:45.870
Most of the greatest minds in history,

00:03:46.030 --> 00:03:48.100
including Jiang Ziya,

00:03:48.150 --> 00:03:50.170
are also the best anglers.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.240
The same goes for chefs.

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.970
A lousy angler

00:03:54.520 --> 00:03:57.780
can’t be a great chef.

00:03:59.110 --> 00:04:00.910
Zhou Yu,

00:04:01.060 --> 00:04:03.430
you still have a lot to learn.

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:06.150
Chef Ruoh...

00:04:06.540 --> 00:04:08.200
How about a one-on-one?

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.550
Coming! It’s coming!

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.400
One more!

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:23.900
See?

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:26.960
My creel is overfilled.

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:28.070
Show-off!

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.160
What an annoying old fart!

00:04:30.450 --> 00:04:31.360
Enough is enough!

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.740
Count me in!

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:35.670
Yes. I’m going to catch a big fish

00:04:35.670 --> 00:04:36.620
to defend our honor as chefs.

00:04:36.850 --> 00:04:38.380
Let’s do it!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:39.530
Yes!

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:42.220
They're taking this game so seriously.

00:04:42.730 --> 00:04:44.170
How old are they?

00:04:46.820 --> 00:04:48.290
Look, Mao!

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:50.270
That’s a big one!

00:04:50.940 --> 00:04:51.680
It is!

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.380
Here’s your chance, father!

00:04:55.920 --> 00:05:01.200
Come on, Zhou Yu! Come on!

00:05:01.820 --> 00:05:02.640
It’s coming.

00:05:11.940 --> 00:05:14.910
Oops, I must be drunk again.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.260
That’s dirty!

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.080
You old fart.

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:25.450
Where are we going, Silang?

00:05:25.880 --> 00:05:28.780
Let's go upstream.

00:05:29.250 --> 00:05:30.900
I bet there are big ones there.

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:32.470
Father will be pissed

00:05:32.510 --> 00:05:34.160
if he finds us missing.

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:35.670
Relax. Don’t worry.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:38.120
Once I get back with fish big as a whale,

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:40.050
their jaws will drop.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.720
Silang!

00:05:42.050 --> 00:05:42.720
Mao!

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:54.340
It’s lunchtime.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.610
Where are Mao and the others?

00:05:57.350 --> 00:05:58.300
Don’t worry.

00:05:58.350 --> 00:05:59.440
They’ll be back

00:05:59.490 --> 00:06:00.970
when their stomachs start to growl.

00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:05.330
Be very careful, Zhou Yu!

00:06:05.720 --> 00:06:07.550
The Dark Cooking Society will be going after you

00:06:07.600 --> 00:06:11.150
and that kid.

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.700
Oh, no!

00:06:15.920 --> 00:06:17.850
We’re in the middle of nowhere

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.330
and we’ve lost our rods.

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.880
What to do now, Mao?

00:06:23.030 --> 00:06:24.710
These bamboo leaves are prickly.

00:06:25.110 --> 00:06:26.590
Tigers and bears

00:06:27.050 --> 00:06:30.350
always hunt in places like this.

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.950
Hey, stop saying that!

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:34.510
It's all your fault

00:06:34.660 --> 00:06:36.050
if the beats

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:37.440
swallow us whole!

00:06:38.870 --> 00:06:39.620
Silang!

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:59.010
Bear! Mao!

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.050
Chef Xie!

00:07:17.890 --> 00:07:19.270
Look who’s here.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:20.550
It’s you kids.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.700
What brings you to the woods?

00:07:23.010 --> 00:07:24.880
We're safe!

00:07:26.100 --> 00:07:26.690
So,

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:30.200
you’re here to fish too.

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:31.970
Yes.

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.960
I’m trying to save money on food.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:36.950
Are you still staying in Guangzhou?

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:40.120
- Come on!
- The Capital of Food is too good

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:42.080
to leave.

00:07:42.650 --> 00:07:43.410
I meant to drop by Young Spring Restaurant

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.910
to visit you.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:47.920
Don’t leave me alone!

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:49.540
I can’t cross this!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:52.820
I’m coming to get you.

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:56.100
Too late!

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.400
This place is beautiful!

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.690
So many rape flowers!

00:08:03.340 --> 00:08:04.990
The seeds must’ve been blown here.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.270
They smell so nice!

00:08:08.030 --> 00:08:10.150
Enough chitchat. I’m getting started.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:12.410
You’re using this steel bar

00:08:12.510 --> 00:08:14.270
for fishing, too?

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:17.690
I’m used to it

00:08:17.910 --> 00:08:18.820
and it’s much better

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:19.850
than those so-called fishing rods.

00:08:20.760 --> 00:08:22.210
There’s one more star on it.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:24.040
That black one

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.090
marks your loss to Mao, right?

00:08:26.190 --> 00:08:26.890
Yes.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.040
I’ll make it

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:29.170
gold again

00:08:29.220 --> 00:08:30.930
someday!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:32.590
Wait for it, Mao!

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:33.510
I will.

00:08:34.050 --> 00:08:35.630
I’m looking forward to another battle,

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:36.510
Chef Xie.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:37.680
Likewise.

00:08:44.220 --> 00:08:46.660
You fish like you cook.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:48.980
You bet.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:52.070
I’m the Dim Sum Master,

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:54.370
Steel Bar Xie,

00:08:54.790 --> 00:08:56.040
always on the way

00:08:56.340 --> 00:08:58.140
to hone my skills!

00:09:02.590 --> 00:09:03.530
You have a bite.

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:05.140
Yes!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:08.840
So cool!

00:09:12.500 --> 00:09:13.340
It’s cute.

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:16.160
Things like this do happen from time to time.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.110
One more fish.

00:09:29.280 --> 00:09:30.420
I heard

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:34.570
you had battled someone from
the Dark Cooking Society.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:36.440
Yes.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:38.570
You won, didn’t you?

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:39.490
I did.

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:43.510
You should know

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.540
things won’t be that easy.

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:50.630
The Dark Cooking Society

00:09:53.070 --> 00:09:55.990
has got eyes and ears everywhere.

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:58.310
Those people

00:09:58.470 --> 00:09:59.910
do things differently.

00:10:00.760 --> 00:10:02.140
You must be careful, Mao.

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:06.220
I’m starving to death!

00:10:06.270 --> 00:10:08.700
Do something, Big Sis!

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:10.990
I’ve told you more than once

00:10:11.030 --> 00:10:12.830
to stop calling me that!

00:10:13.410 --> 00:10:15.170
We end up here because of you!

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:16.720
You proposed to go upstream

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:19.180
and we got lost.

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.330
Still,

00:10:21.380 --> 00:10:24.050
I’m dying here!

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.740
I should be the one crying.

00:10:27.490 --> 00:10:29.730
Do you know how excited I was

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:31.870
to have a picnic outside?

00:10:32.380 --> 00:10:32.920
Oh,

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:37.380
my stomach...

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:42.870
I got it!

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:46.050
Chef Xie can cook for us

00:10:46.100 --> 00:10:48.790
with the fish he caught.

00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:49.590
You can’t eat them.

00:10:50.130 --> 00:10:51.780
Why not? Don’t be so cheap!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.350
You got me wrong.

00:10:53.700 --> 00:10:54.920
It takes at least half a day

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:58.190
for those carps to clean their stomachs,

00:10:58.570 --> 00:10:59.800
or they’ll taste

00:10:59.900 --> 00:11:01.250
too muddy.

00:11:01.370 --> 00:11:02.560
Half a day?

00:11:03.300 --> 00:11:06.360
I can’t wait that long!

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:08.260
Is this the end of my life?

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:12.080
Can you do something, Mao?

00:11:15.180 --> 00:11:16.450
Not this time.

00:11:16.500 --> 00:11:17.640
Even his hands are tied.

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.150
There’s no other way.

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:41.010
Maybe there is one!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.040
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:11:53.220 --> 00:11:55.280
You got any flour with you, Chef Xie?

00:11:55.630 --> 00:11:56.090
Yes.

00:11:56.570 --> 00:11:58.670
I wouldn’t go camping

00:11:58.960 --> 00:12:00.030
without it.

00:12:01.480 --> 00:12:02.710
What are you thinking, Mao?

00:12:03.200 --> 00:12:04.080
Mao...

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.350
Meili, go get

00:12:06.460 --> 00:12:07.920
as many rape flowers as you can.

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:09.780
Rape flowers?

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.220
Rape flowers...

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.090
I see. You’re smart.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:15.640
Chef Xie, may I borrow your knife?

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:16.830
Help yourself.

00:12:17.220 --> 00:12:18.680
This looks fun.

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:20.250
Let me help you.

00:12:20.770 --> 00:12:22.510
Me too, Mao.

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:26.500
You can’t even cook vegetables right.

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:27.890
Just stay out of it!

00:12:28.370 --> 00:12:29.170
Humph!

00:12:31.640 --> 00:12:33.340
Damn it! I’m not that bad!

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:36.300
I’m also on my way to be a chef.

00:12:46.050 --> 00:12:47.790
Alright. Let’s get started.

00:13:13.760 --> 00:13:14.390
Chef Xie!

00:13:14.570 --> 00:13:15.150
Got it!

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:19.890
Chef Xie!

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:20.810
Got it!

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.370
You freaked me out!

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:30.670
Oh, Meili,

00:13:30.780 --> 00:13:31.590
sorry about that.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.130
What are you guys doing?

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:35.900
Meili, put those flowers

00:13:36.020 --> 00:13:37.500
in the pot.

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:41.500
All of them?

00:13:42.730 --> 00:13:44.080
Yes, all of them.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:47.690
Get in!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.440
The strong scent of those flowers

00:13:51.590 --> 00:13:53.200
will cover the muddy smell of the carps,

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.650
correct?

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.100
Exactly.

00:13:56.810 --> 00:13:57.980
We got a problem.

00:13:58.380 --> 00:13:59.080
This fire

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.800
isn’t half as strong

00:14:00.850 --> 00:14:02.240
as that in the kitchen.

00:14:02.880 --> 00:14:04.540
Undercooked carp

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:05.980
will give us the runs.

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:07.500
But they’re too fresh

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:10.240
to be cooked

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:12.460
for too long.

00:14:12.550 --> 00:14:13.670
Or their taste

00:14:14.320 --> 00:14:15.310
will be ruined.

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:19.950
Heated rocks!

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:22.430
They’re my secret weapons!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.110
They're boiled right away!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:28.240
Chef Xie and I

00:14:28.290 --> 00:14:29.650
present the outdoor dish,

00:14:29.880 --> 00:14:33.080
fish dumplings!

00:14:35.290 --> 00:14:36.990
Take a bite, Meili.

00:14:37.900 --> 00:14:38.770
Thanks.

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:41.080
It looks so great!

00:14:41.380 --> 00:14:42.380
I’m digging in.

00:14:50.560 --> 00:14:53.450
It doesn’t taste muddy at all.

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:55.360
The meat is so tender

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:57.400
that I don’t need to chew.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.350
I can’t believe you turned the carp

00:14:59.400 --> 00:15:00.730
into something so tasty!

00:15:01.300 --> 00:15:02.130
I ground the fish

00:15:02.420 --> 00:15:04.850
and stuffed it

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:05.780
into the wrappers made of flour,

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:07.200
and used

00:15:07.790 --> 00:15:09.560
fish heads and bones to make the soup.

00:15:10.100 --> 00:15:11.700
The heated rocks

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:13.740
boiled the dumplings instantly,

00:15:14.010 --> 00:15:16.990
so the fish still tastes fresh.

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.430
Meanwhile, the bitterness of the flowers

00:15:20.570 --> 00:15:22.860
balanced the taste of the carp.

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.010
That’s a bite of nature

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.780
in one dumpling!

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.100
This is amazing!

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:32.790
You made such a delicacy

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:33.930
out of nothing.

00:15:34.040 --> 00:15:35.210
Look around,

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:38.170
nature is a giant pantry.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:42.110
And we have two master chefs here.

00:15:42.510 --> 00:15:43.650
It’s easy to whip up

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:44.720
a delicious lunch.

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:46.760
I couldn’t be happier

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:48.840
enjoying freshly-made food

00:15:48.890 --> 00:15:50.550
and the views around us!

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:51.870
This kind of taste

00:15:52.120 --> 00:15:53.840
can’t be found

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:55.440
in any fancy restaurants,

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:56.940
right, Mao?

00:15:57.280 --> 00:15:57.790
Meili,

00:15:58.110 --> 00:15:59.340
are you happy now?

00:15:59.460 --> 00:16:01.770
I am. Thanks to Silang.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.790
All smiles again with a full stomach.

00:16:08.070 --> 00:16:08.800
Wait.

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:11.000
Where’s Silang?

00:16:13.170 --> 00:16:14.380
Is something burning?

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:15.920
Over there.

00:16:18.470 --> 00:16:20.100
What is he doing?

00:16:23.270 --> 00:16:25.290
Silang, what’s this?

00:16:27.780 --> 00:16:29.860
I’m making smoked carp.

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.190
Good idea.

00:16:31.690 --> 00:16:33.890
The smoke will remove the muddy smell as well.

00:16:34.290 --> 00:16:35.860
Nice trick!

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:39.080
I'm sort of a chef after all.

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.360
But I need more smoke

00:16:41.410 --> 00:16:43.270
to get it right.

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:44.860
Is there anything I can burn?

00:16:49.880 --> 00:16:50.880
There’s an old rug.

00:16:54.050 --> 00:16:55.980
That... That’s...

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.640
It’s on!

00:16:59.510 --> 00:17:00.960
Stop!

00:17:01.010 --> 00:17:02.940
Nice! Let the fire do the magic.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.590
Can’t wait to taste the smoked fish.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:06.870
Go on!

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:08.270
No!

00:17:08.370 --> 00:17:09.550
Go on!

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.840
Are you alright, Chef Xie?

00:17:19.380 --> 00:17:20.140
You fool!

00:17:20.420 --> 00:17:21.720
All my money

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.410
was in this bag!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:26.230
All your money...

00:17:26.420 --> 00:17:28.600
Every penny

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.190
is burned into ashes!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.670
Welcome, everyone!

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:44.200
Feel free

00:17:44.250 --> 00:17:45.390
to come and have a taste.

00:17:45.730 --> 00:17:47.960
Try my delicious shumai.

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:49.830
It’s the best in the country!

00:17:50.240 --> 00:17:51.840
I guarantee you,

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:54.030
you’ve had nothing like this before.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:55.370
Look at Chef Xie.

00:17:55.950 --> 00:17:58.180
He’s having a stall right next to our restaurant.

00:17:59.000 --> 00:18:00.750
That man is bold

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.440
and thick-skinned!

00:18:02.900 --> 00:18:04.060
He said

00:18:04.110 --> 00:18:06.590
he’d stick around until he got
enough money to travel again.

00:18:06.900 --> 00:18:08.690
Focus! You’ve got work to do!

00:18:09.960 --> 00:18:11.610
You burned all my money,

00:18:11.660 --> 00:18:13.590
so you’ll pay it back by working.

00:18:14.420 --> 00:18:15.730
Here you are, 10 shrimp shumais.

00:18:15.780 --> 00:18:16.760
Sorry for the wait.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:18.040
The extra three are free.

00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:19.800
Help!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:26.210
Checkmate!

00:18:27.250 --> 00:18:29.150
Wait! Let me try again.

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:30.620
No way! No taking back!

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.910
Please, just one more time!

00:18:33.050 --> 00:18:34.720
Come on, Mao!

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:36.660
I’m home.

00:18:37.280 --> 00:18:39.280
What a day!

00:18:39.480 --> 00:18:41.420
You must be happy that your business went well,

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:41.960
Silang.

00:18:42.590 --> 00:18:44.420
Happy my foot!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:46.330
Ouch!

00:18:46.650 --> 00:18:49.680
I’m not getting paid.

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:50.860
And whose fault is that?

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:52.700
You made the mistake.

00:18:52.820 --> 00:18:53.400
Humph!

00:18:53.600 --> 00:18:54.710
You looks so pretty,

00:18:54.710 --> 00:18:55.970
yet you are so mean.

00:18:56.150 --> 00:18:57.800
Where’s Chef Xie?

00:18:57.970 --> 00:18:58.670
He’s left

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.960
to get a drink.

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:03.410
Fine. How about we go out

00:19:03.670 --> 00:19:05.640
and grab a bite?

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:07.680
My treat.

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:08.650
Great!

00:19:08.680 --> 00:19:10.590
Meili is the best!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:14.670
My shumai sold as well as I expected.

00:19:15.090 --> 00:19:16.060
In this case,

00:19:16.110 --> 00:19:17.200
I’ll get enough money

00:19:17.250 --> 00:19:18.880
to cover the loss in no time.

00:19:20.120 --> 00:19:22.400
This is it.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:26.380
Hey, open the door!

00:19:26.900 --> 00:19:28.010
Open it!

00:19:28.610 --> 00:19:30.010
How come no one is at home?

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:33.920
I bought meat buns for those kids.

00:19:34.090 --> 00:19:35.270
Why bother anyway?

00:19:36.680 --> 00:19:37.790
Who are you?

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:39.930
You must be Steel Bar Xie.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:43.590
Am I a household name now?

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:47.990
I’m looking for the chef who defeated Li Yan.

00:19:48.550 --> 00:19:49.830
Don’t stand in my way.

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:51.900
What did you say, punk?

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:54.170
It's good to see you, though.

00:19:54.510 --> 00:19:57.120
Your cooking tool is mine.

00:19:57.600 --> 00:19:58.670
Pardon?

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:00.540
Come and grab it if you can!

00:20:17.430 --> 00:20:18.210
Bastard!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:27.260
Cooking tools mean the world to chefs.

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.130
Your shumai is just a crap

00:20:29.180 --> 00:20:30.850
without the steel bar.

00:20:31.110 --> 00:20:32.640
How dare you! Who the hell are you?

00:20:33.020 --> 00:20:35.890
Thanks for the tool.

00:20:39.470 --> 00:20:40.190
Is that...?

00:20:42.250 --> 00:20:42.980
Wait!

00:20:44.850 --> 00:20:47.170
It’s good to eat out occasionally.

00:20:47.540 --> 00:20:48.780
We can learn from our peers.

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:51.590
I’m stuffed!

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:52.600
Silang,

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.710
why did you order those expensive foods?

00:20:54.860 --> 00:20:56.460
My pocket is empty.

00:20:56.570 --> 00:20:58.770
I’ve helped you so much.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.060
Consider that a thank-you gift.

00:21:01.620 --> 00:21:03.710
When did you ever help me?

00:21:04.500 --> 00:21:07.780
Someone passed out in front of our restaurant.

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:12.310
Chef Xie!

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:14.210
What happened, Chef Xie?

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.670
Chef Xie, hang in there!

00:21:18.550 --> 00:21:19.950
He took your steel bar?

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:21.730
I’m telling you

00:21:22.220 --> 00:21:24.010
he’s with the Dark Cooking Society.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:26.160
Their members

00:21:26.510 --> 00:21:28.740
have infiltrated into Guangzhou.

00:21:29.170 --> 00:21:29.850
Mao!

00:21:30.500 --> 00:21:31.110
Mao!

00:21:31.800 --> 00:21:33.410
You and Chef Zhou Yu

00:21:33.820 --> 00:21:35.440
beat their chefs.

00:21:36.280 --> 00:21:37.520
They may come at you

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:38.330
anytime.

00:21:38.760 --> 00:21:41.500
It’s bad, Mao.

00:21:43.330 --> 00:21:44.290
The Dark Cooking Society...

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.895 --> 00:23:22.525
He came to the Yang Spring Restaurant out of nowhere
after Xie Lu was attacked.

00:23:22.608 --> 00:23:24.694
On the left hand of that guy who uses underworld tricks

00:23:24.819 --> 00:23:26.904
is the emblem of the Dark Cooking Society.

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:28.906
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:28.948 --> 00:23:30.408
Underworld Hitman:

00:23:30.491 --> 00:23:32.285
Cold-Hearted Genius Lei En

00:23:32.368 --> 00:23:34.038
It will definitely be interesting!
